<title>UK: DHL wins bagpipe flying contract.</title>
<headline>DHL wins bagpipe flying contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>DHL International (UK)Ltd said it has gained the express delivery contract for Bagpipes Galore in Edinburgh, one of Scotland's leading bagpipe suppliers.</p>
<p>DHL said it will carry bagpipes -- weighing three to four kg --and bagpipe parts to players around the world, with the U.S. and Australia as key markets. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
